        ],
        hints: [`Factorise $${EIGHTEEN.value}$ into twos and threes.`],
        workedSolution: `$${EIGHTEEN.value} = 2 \\times 3^{2}$.\nSo $\\log ${EIGHTEEN.value} = \\log 2 + \\log 3^{2} = m + 2n$.`,
        commonErrors: [
